  "description": "The Double Peak 29\" Trail model features a low stand-over height frame with low center of gravity made from X6 series alloy, with an internal head tube and internal cable routing. The DP Trail model features a new Shimano Altus 2x9 drive train, versatile and capable of handling a wide variety of terrain. It glides along on 29\" double wall rims, stainless spokes and 2.2\" tires. The front end features a Suntour XCT-30 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout. The Trail appreciates speed, but it can stop on a dime thanks to its Shimano MT-200 Hydraulic disc brake set.\nDouble Peak 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nSuntour XCT-30 HLO 100mm travel fork\nNew Shimano MT101-2 crankset, 36/22T, 2x9, w/ sealed cartridge BB\nNew Shimano Altus M2020-M, 2x9 front derailleur\nNew Shimano Altus M2000 9-spd rear derailleur\nNew Shimano Altus SL-M2010 2x9 shifters\nShimano HG-200 9-spd 11-36T cassette\nXD-180 alloy DW rims\nShimano MT-200 hydraulic disc brakeset, Center Lock",
